	(text "The I2C port is an undocumented,\nunsupported feature.\n\nPopulate if target I2C does NOT have \npull-up resistors. User to handle \nground loop avoidance and determine \npull-up resistor stiffness.\n\nParallel resistors can drive I2C \ncurrent dangerously high (>3mA)!"
